# Reproducing the Rainbow motion review

The tested setup runs headlessly in a disposable Codex Cloud workspace. An Android phone can request a run and open the resulting images and MP4 files. A remote workstation is optional for interactive Blender editing or Android hardware profiling. Each new cloud workspace needs its tools and loopback connections restored from the recorded versions.

